ιν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-529"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-530]: ἄμωμος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-530"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-531]: Cf. Luke xiv. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-531"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-532]: Cf. 1 Cor. i. 29 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-532"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-533]: τὸν ἄπειρον αἰῶνα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-533"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-534]: συνεργηθῆναι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-534"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-535]: ἀναστοιχειωθῆναι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-535"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-536]: πεντηκονταετίαν . Rufinus has “ sexaginta annos .”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-536"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-537]: ἀπέραντον αἰῶνα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-537"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-538]: εἰκόνι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-538"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-539]: τάχιον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-539"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-540]: προπετέστερον, καὶ οὐχὶ ὁδῷ ἐπ᾽ αὐτὰ ὁδευσάσῃ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-540"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-541]: Cf. Wisd. vii. 16 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-541"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-542]: Ezek. xi. 19, 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-542"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-543]: ἀπὸ τῶν ψιλῶν ῥητῶν τὸ ἐφ᾽ ἡμῖν ἀναιρῶν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-543"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-544]